Scenario: Site Memberships Pagination
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Site Administration,Users and Organizations|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add Multiple CP
		|numberOfUsers|10|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Memberships|
	And Site add All Members CP
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Memberships|
	And Site view Member List CP
		|usersEmailsList|userea1@liferay.com,userea2@liferay.com,userea3@liferay.com,userea4@liferay.com,userea5@liferay.com,userea6@liferay.com,userea7@liferay.com,userea8@liferay.com,userea9@liferay.com,userea10@liferay.com|
	And Site view Member CP
		|userFirstName|Test|
		|userLastName|Test|
		|userScreenName|test|
	And Navigator goto Nav Item
		|navItem|Users|
	And AssertClick the value '20 Entries' at locator 'Pagination#ITEMS_PER_PAGE_SELECT'
	And Click at locator 'Pagination#FIVE_ITEMS_PER_PAGE'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Showing 1 to 5 of 11 entries.' at locator 'Pagination#CURRENT_PAGE_SELECT'
	And Click at locator 'Pagination#NEXT_LINK'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Showing 6 to 10 of 11 entries.' at locator 'Pagination#CURRENT_PAGE_SELECT'
	And Site assert Member List Not Visible CP
		|usersEmailsList|userfn1@liferay.com,userfn2@liferay.com,userfn3@liferay.com,userfn10@liferay.com|
	And Site view Member List CP
		|usersEmailsList|userea4@liferay.com,userea5@liferay.com,userea6@liferay.com,userea7@liferay.com,userea8@liferay.com|
	And Site assert Member List Not Visible CP
		|usersEmailsList|userea9@liferay.com|
	And Click at locator 'Pagination#FIRST_LINK'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Showing 1 to 5 of 11 entries.' at locator 'Pagination#CURRENT_PAGE_SELECT'
	And Site view Member List CP
		|usersEmailsList|userea1@liferay.com,userea2@liferay.com,userea3@liferay.com,userea10@liferay.com|
	And Site assert Member List Not Visible CP
		|usersEmailsList|userea4@liferay.com,userea5@liferay.com,userea6@liferay.com,userea7@liferay.com,userea8@liferay.com,userea9@liferay.com|
