	And Site assert Member List Not Visible CP
		|usersEmailsList|userea1@liferay.com,userea2@liferay.com,userea3@liferay.com,userea4@liferay.com,userea5@liferay.com,userea6@liferay.com,userea7@liferay.com,userea8@liferay.com,userea10@liferay.com|
